abstract: >-
  QuantPlay is a browser-based 6-max No-Limit Hold'em trainer (Python running in the visitor's browser via
  Pyodide) and the poker-bot laboratory it grew out of: an engine with a preflop blueprint, postflop math and a
  measured guard chain, an opponent league, tournament/ICM doctrine, benchmark harnesses (GTO Wizard AI,
  Slumbot, Kaggle Game Arena, PokerSnowie), and two catalogues documenting every module and every measurement,
  including the ideas that were refuted.
